{"id": "EUVD-2026-97593", "enisaUuid": "62a8b54d-4092-31a5-810f-40cc4404edcb", "description": "Open WebUI from 0.6.33 before 0.11.4 contains a cross-site scripting vulnerability that allows authenticated users to execute script in victims' sessions by storing javascript: URLs in citation embed_url fields. Attackers can share a crafted chat whose citation, when clicked, is passed to window.open, letting them steal localStorage.token and act as the victim.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:04:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T12:03:15", "baseScore": 8.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-qpqv-xwg8-cqpj", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/open-webui-0.6.33-before-0.11.4-stored-xss-via-citation-embed-url"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109291", "GHSA-g5hc-j8wv-8p98"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0a880b0c-3039-3cb0-b378-e558a8a382eb", "product": {"name": "open-webui", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}, "product_version": "0.6.33 <0.11.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "13ec0f53-ccb7-35c5-af60-0ccdd68118e6", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}], "isExploited": false}